(34, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:13', '2026-04-27 21:49:13', 'Capture a special moment with our Custom Line Art Portrait T-Shirt. Simply upload a photo of you and a loved one, and our artists will transform it into a sleek, minimalist line drawing. This unique design is then precisely applied to our premium, heavyweight cotton T-shirts. It’s the perfect personalized gift for anniversaries, birthdays, or just because. This T-shirt features a clean, modern aesthetic that pairs effortlessly with any wardrobe.', 'The \"Your Photo\" Custom Line Art T-Shirt', 'Turn your favorite memories into wearable art with our custom-drawn line portrait T-shirts.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'the-your-photo-custom-line-art-t-shirt', '', '', '2026-04-28 20:41:11', '2026-04-28 20:41:11', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/the-your-photo-custom-line-art-t-shirt/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(35, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:13', '2026-04-27 21:49:13', 'Make your milestone unforgettable with our Personalized Anniversary T-Shirts. Designed for couples who appreciate a minimalist yet meaningful style, these shirts feature a bold \"MR.\" or \"MRS.\" block graphic overlaid with your custom family name in elegant script.', 'Custom Mr. & Mrs. Est. Date Anniversary T-Shirt', 'Celebrate your special milestone with these personalized \"Mr. &amp; Mrs.\" tees. Custom-printed with your last name and wedding date, these shirts offer a modern, aesthetic look for anniversaries, honeymooning, or casual couple photoshoots.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'custom-mr-mrs-est-date-anniversary-t-shirt', '', '', '2026-04-28 19:03:40', '2026-04-28 19:03:40', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/custom-mr-mrs-est-date-anniversary-t-shirt/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(36, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Elevate your loungewear with our Personalized Anniversary Hoodies. Featuring a premium, heavy-weight feel and a modern aesthetic, these hoodies showcase a bold \"MR.\" or \"MRS.\" graphic customized with your specific details.', 'Personalized Mr. & Mrs. Est. Date Anniversary Hoodie', 'Stay cozy and celebrated in our custom \"Mr. &amp; Mrs.\" hoodies. Personalized with your unique last name and anniversary date, these hoodies are the perfect blend of comfort and sentimental style for any couple.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'personalized-mr-mrs-est-date-anniversary-hoodie', '', '', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/personalized-mr-mrs-est-date-anniversary-hoodie/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(37, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Keep your loved ones close with our Custom Initial Sleeve Hoodies. Unlike traditional front-print designs, these hoodies offer a sophisticated, \"hidden\" detail located right on the wrist. Each piece is personalized with a high-quality initial and a matching heart, making it a unique keepsake for couples, best friends, or family.', 'Custom Initial & Heart Sleeve Embroidered Hoodie', 'Wear your heart on your sleeve with these minimalist personalized hoodies. Featuring a delicate initial and heart design on the cuff, they are the perfect subtle way to celebrate your partner or a loved one.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'custom-initial-heart-sleeve-embroidered-hoodie', '', '', '2026-04-28 13:06:15', '2026-04-28 13:06:15', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/custom-initial-heart-sleeve-embroidered-hoodie/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(38, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Capture a moment in time with our Custom Photo Memory Hoodies. Designed for those who want their clothing to tell a story, these hoodies allow you to feature your own photographs on the back. Choose between a modern photo-to-line-art sketch overlay or a classic double-photo layout with personalized initials.', 'Custom Polaroid Photo & Line Art Personalized Hoodie', 'Turn your favorite memories into wearable art. These custom hoodies feature your personal photos in a vintage Polaroid style, paired with custom line-art illustrations or handwritten initials for a truly one-of-a-kind look.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'custom-polaroid-photo-line-art-personalized-hoodie', '', '', '2026-04-28 21:51:45', '2026-04-28 21:51:45', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/custom-polaroid-photo-line-art-personalized-hoodie/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(39, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Embrace the \"perfectly imperfect\" aesthetic with our Hand-Painted Personalized Mug Set. These aren\'t your standard factory-made mugs; each piece features a unique, wavy organic silhouette and artisan-style brushstrokes.', 'Personalized Ceramic Hubby & Wifey Striped Mug Set', 'Add a touch of handmade charm to your morning coffee with these custom \"Hubby\" and \"Wifey\" ceramic mugs. Featuring playful hand-painted stripes and a rustic, organic shape, they make the perfect personalized gift for newlyweds or anniversaries.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'personalized-ceramic-hubby-wifey-striped-mug-set', '', '', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/personalized-ceramic-hubby-wifey-striped-mug-set/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(40, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Celebrate your unique bond with our Custom Speckled Stoneware Mug. This piece combines a rustic, earthy aesthetic with clean, modern personalization. The two-tone design features a cream-speckled top and a natural terracotta-style base, offering a sophisticated look that fits perfectly in any kitchen.', 'Personalized Script Initial & Date Speckled Stoneware Mug', 'Elevate your daily coffee ritual with this elegant, personalized stoneware mug. Featuring a modern script initial design connected by a heart, along with your names and special date, it\'s a timeless keepsake for any couple.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'personalized-script-initial-date-speckled-stoneware-mug', '', '', '2026-04-28 07:59:04', '2026-04-28 07:59:04', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/personalized-script-initial-date-speckled-stoneware-mug/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(41, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Add a playful spark to your relationship with our Custom Comic Interaction Mugs. These mugs feature a two-part storytelling design: one person \"shooting\" love arrows and the other \"caught\" in the crossfire. It’s a lighthearted, adorable way to enjoy coffee together.', 'Personalized \"Cupid’s Arrow\" Comic Couple Mug Set', 'Bring some humor to your morning brew with these interactive comic-style mugs. Featuring a playful \"Cupid\" design that interacts from one mug to the other, these personalized cups are a fun and quirky way to show your love.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'personalized-cupids-arrow-comic-couple-mug-set', '', '', '2026-04-28 08:02:33', '2026-04-28 08:02:33', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/personalized-cupids-arrow-comic-couple-mug-set/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(42, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Celebrate your connection with our Magnetic \"Soulmate\" Keychain Set. These handcrafted-style charms are designed for couples, best friends, or siblings who want a physical reminder of their special link. The highlight of this set is the central silver heart—split into two halves that magnetically attract', 'Magnetic Heart Couple’s Keychain Set - Butterfly & Angel Wing Charms', 'Stay connected wherever you go with this charming magnetic keychain set. Featuring delicate butterflies, angel wings, and a magnetic heart that snaps together when close, it’s the perfect symbol of an unbreakable bond.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'magnetic-heart-couples-keychain-set-butterfly-angel-wing-charms', '', '', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/magnetic-heart-couples-keychain-set-butterfly-angel-wing-charms/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(43, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Double the cuteness with our Magnetic Huggy Bear Keychain Set. These 3D figurines are designed to represent the perfect pair. Each bear contains a hidden internal magnet on its flat side, allowing them to snap together into a sweet embrace when joined.', 'Magnetic Hugging Bear Couple’s Keychain Set', 'Keep your better half close with these adorable hugging bear keychains. Featuring a clever magnetic connection, these two bears \"hug\" together whenever they meet—a perfect symbol for couples who are inseparable.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'magnetic-hugging-bear-couples-keychain-set', '', '', '2026-04-28 08:55:23', '2026-04-28 08:55:23', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/magnetic-hugging-bear-couples-keychain-set/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(44, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'The ultimate duo-wear has arrived. These matching best friend hoodies are designed to complement each other perfectly, featuring a large, artistic pink ribbon bow on the back that stands out against the classic black and white colorways.\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re the \"Black\" or \"White\" aesthetic friend, these hoodies bring a unified look to your friendship. Each piece is crafted with a soft, fleece-lined interior and a relaxed drop-shoulder fit, ensuring you and your bestie stay comfortable while looking iconic. The minimalist front allows you to layer your favorite necklaces, while the back makes a bold, feminine statement that is tailor-made for social media and street style.', 'Bestie Aesthetic Oversized Ribbon Bow Matching Hoodies', 'Celebrate your bond with these matching \"Coquette\" ribbon bow hoodies. Designed for best friends who love a coordinated aesthetic, these oversized pieces feature a stunning pink bow graphic on the back—perfect for your next photo op.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'bestie-aesthetic-oversized-ribbon-bow-matching-hoodies', '', '', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/bestie-aesthetic-oversized-ribbon-bow-matching-hoodies/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(45, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Elevate your matching game with these premium, heavy-blend hoodies. Designed for those who love a mix of edgy and sweet aesthetics, these hoodies feature a large, intricate heart-shaped spider web embroidered on the chest.\r\n\r\nThe attention to detail extends to the cuffs, where a personalized initial sits next to a delicate heart, adding a custom touch to your everyday streetwear. Crafted from a soft cotton-poly blend with a spacious front pocket and adjustable drawstring hood, these hoodies offer both comfort and durability. Whether you’re going for the \"Pink &amp; Black\" aesthetic or simply want a meaningful gift, this set is designed to last.', 'Heart Web Initial & Heart Embroidered Matching Hoodies', 'Stay connected with these matching embroidered hoodies featuring a unique heart-shaped spider web design. Each sleeve is personalized with a custom initial and a small heart, making them the perfect cozy statement for best friends or couples.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'heart-web-initial-heart-embroidered-matching-hoodies', '', '', '2026-04-28 10:08:44', '2026-04-28 10:08:44', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/heart-web-initial-heart-embroidered-matching-hoodies/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(46, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Wear your friendship with pride in our Varsity-inspired Besties Matching Hoodie Set. Designed with a timeless collegiate font, the chest features a bold \"BESTIES\" embroidery with an customizable \"EST.\" date to mark the year your bond began.\r\n\r\nThe standout feature is the personalized sleeve detail: have both of your names delicately embroidered on the cuff, joined by a heart, so your bestie is always \"on your sleeve.\" Crafted from a heavy-blend premium cotton fleece, these hoodies offer a cozy, high-quality feel that stands the test of time. Available in contrasting Maroon and White, these sets are perfect for travel, campus life, or a thoughtful birthday surprise for your closest friend.', 'Besties Established Matching Sleeve Embroidery Hoodies', 'Commemorate your friendship with these \"Besties\" collegiate-style matching hoodies. Featuring a vintage \"EST. 2025\" chest design and custom name embroidery on the sleeve, they are the ultimate personalized gift for you and your best friend.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'besties-established-matching-sleeve-embroidery-hoodies', '', '', '2026-04-27 23:04:04', '2026-04-27 23:04:04', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/besties-established-matching-sleeve-embroidery-hoodies/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(47, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'The world\'s most famous duo is here to upgrade your couple goals. These matching t-shirts feature Tom and Jerry in a bold, layered graphic on the back—Tom standing tall on the black tee and Jerry looking mischievous on the white tee.\r\n\r\nDesigned with a modern streetwear fit, the front of each shirt keeps it clean with a small \"Tom and Jerry\" logo on the chest. Made from premium, breathable cotton, these shirts offer a soft-touch feel and a relaxed silhouette, making them ideal for theme park dates, casual outings, or just showing the world who the Tom to your Jerry is. Whether you’re the cat or the mouse in the relationship, this set is a must-have for any fan of the legendary rivalry.', 'Tom & Jerry Iconic Character Matching Couple T-Shirts', 'Relive the classic chase with these matching Tom &amp; Jerry t-shirts for couples. Featuring high-quality character graphics on the back and a minimalist logo on the front, these tees are the perfect way to show off your playful dynamic.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'tom-jerry-iconic-character-matching-couple-t-shirts', '', '', '2026-04-28 22:01:21', '2026-04-28 22:01:21', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/tom-jerry-iconic-character-matching-couple-t-shirts/', 0, 'product', '', 0);
