(48, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Bring a playful energy to your relationship with our Hugging Hearts Matching Set. These sweatshirts feature a unique, two-tone pink and purple heart graphic on the chest, designed with cute interlocking characters that symbolize being better together.\r\n\r\nCrafted with a modern, oversized streetwear silhouette, these black pullovers are made from a high-quality cotton blend that offers ultimate comfort for date nights or casual hangouts. The drop-shoulder design and ribbed collar provide a relaxed look that fits both men and women perfectly. Whether you\'re celebrating an anniversary or just want to show off your dynamic, this set is a fun, stylish way to stay coordinated with your partner.', '\"Hugging Hearts\" Aesthetic Matching Couple Sweatshirts', 'Celebrate your connection with these \"Hugging Hearts\" matching sweatshirts. Featuring a whimsical, interlocking heart graphic that completes the picture when you\'re together, these oversized black pullovers are the perfect cozy statement for couples.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'hugging-hearts-aesthetic-matching-couple-sweatshirts', '', '', '2026-04-28 22:02:57', '2026-04-28 22:02:57', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/hugging-hearts-aesthetic-matching-couple-sweatshirts/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(49, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Embrace effortless style with this matching loungewear set. Designed for comfort and versatility, the set includes an oversized, short-sleeve button-up shirt with a classic collar and a pair of relaxed-fit shorts.\r\n\r\nThe crisp cream fabric is accented by a vibrant red heart embroidered on the left chest, adding a subtle touch of personality to a clean, modern silhouette. Perfect for casual summer outings, beach days, or stylish home lounging.', 'Heart Embroidery Matching Linen Set', 'A coordinated two-piece set featuring a short-sleeve button-down shirt and matching shorts, crafted from breathable fabric with a minimalist heart embroidery on the chest.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'heart-embroidery-matching-linen-set', '', '', '2026-04-28 13:13:07', '2026-04-28 13:13:07', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/heart-embroidery-matching-linen-set/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(50, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Celebrate family bonds with this adorable matching t-shirt set. Each shirt is crafted from a soft, breathable cotton blend in a versatile heather grey, featuring a bold navy blue bear silhouette. The designs are customized for every family member with \"Papa Bear,\" \"Mama Bear,\" and \"Little Bear\" text integrated into the graphic.\r\n\r\nPerfect for family photoshoots, holiday gatherings, or casual weekend outings, these shirts offer a coordinated look that is both comfortable and picture-perfect. The set can be paired with matching navy joggers or denim for a complete family ensemble.', '\"Bear Family\" Matching Heather Grey T-Shirt Set', 'A charming collection of matching family t-shirts featuring \"Papa Bear,\" \"Mama Bear,\" and \"Little Bear\" graphics in a classic heather grey finish.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'bear-family-matching-heather-grey-t-shirt-set', '', '', '2026-04-28 22:05:38', '2026-04-28 22:05:38', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/bear-family-matching-heather-grey-t-shirt-set/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(51, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Celebrate the balance of exploration and comfort with this matching family collection. This set offers a creative twist on the traditional matching look by featuring two complementary designs. The \"Wanderlust\" shirts feature a vibrant compass and mountain graphic, while the \"Basecamp\" shirts showcase a charming hand-drawn treehouse.\r\n\r\nAvailable in both deep forest green and classic heather grey, these t-shirts are made from a soft-touch cotton blend that ensures all-day comfort. Whether you\'re heading out on a weekend hike or enjoying a cozy \"basecamp\" day at home, these shirts provide a perfectly synchronized look for the whole crew.', '\"Adventure & Home\" Matching Family T-Shirt Collection', 'A coordinated family t-shirt set featuring two unique, nature-inspired designs: the \"Wanderlust Adventures\" compass and the \"Basecamp Home\" treehouse, printed on premium heathered fabric.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'adventure-home-matching-family-t-shirt-collection', '', '', '2026-04-28 17:57:40', '2026-04-28 17:57:40', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/adventure-home-matching-family-t-shirt-collection/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(52, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Make your holiday memories unforgettable with this perfectly coordinated family pajama set. Designed for ultimate comfort during the winter season, these matching sets feature a soft heather grey long-sleeve top adorned with a modern \"Oh Deer\" reindeer silhouette and heart graphic.\r\n\r\nThe festive look is completed with vibrant red and black buffalo check plaid on the sleeves and matching full-length trousers. Available in sizes for adults, children, and infants (as a coordinated romper), this set is the ideal choice for Christmas morning photos, holiday movie marathons, or festive family gatherings.', '\"Oh Deer\" Matching Family Holiday Pajama Set', 'A festive and cozy matching pajama collection for the whole family, featuring a playful reindeer graphic and classic red-and-black buffalo plaid accents.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'oh-deer-matching-family-holiday-pajama-set', '', '', '2026-04-28 13:30:08', '2026-04-28 13:30:08', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/oh-deer-matching-family-holiday-pajama-set/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(53, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Celebrate love and modern style with this matching family apparel set. These comfortable black long-sleeve tees feature a bold, high-quality graphic of a red heart character performing the \"dab\" dance move, complete with sleek sunglasses and trendy sneakers.\r\n\r\nDesigned for a coordinated look, this set allows parents and children to match effortlessly. Whether you\'re planning a holiday photoshoot, a themed party, or just a fun day out, these shirts offer a playful twist on classic Valentine’s Day attire. Made from soft, breathable fabric with a standard crew neck and ribbed cuffs for a relaxed yet polished fit.', 'Family Matching \"Dabbing Heart\" Graphic Long Sleeve Tee', 'A fun and vibrant matching long sleeve t-shirt set featuring a stylish dabbing heart mascot, perfect for family photos and Valentine’s Day.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'family-matching-dabbing-heart-graphic-long-sleeve-tee', '', '', '2026-04-28 12:52:07', '2026-04-28 12:52:07', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/family-matching-dabbing-heart-graphic-long-sleeve-tee/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(54, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Capture the perfect \"mini-me\" moment with this elegant matching mother and daughter dress set. These light blue shirt dresses feature a timeless white vertical stripe pattern, blending a sophisticated collared look with a playful, relaxed fit.\r\n\r\nThe design includes a functional button-down front and a flattering high-waisted babydoll seam that creates a soft, flared skirt. Crafted from lightweight, breathable fabric, these dresses are ideal for sunny outings, weekend brunches, or family vacations. The short sleeves and classic collar ensure a look that is both polished and comfortable for all-day wear.', 'Mother & Daughter Matching Striped Babydoll Shirt Dress', 'A charming and breezy matching shirt dress set for moms and littles, featuring classic vertical stripes and a comfortable babydoll silhouette.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'mother-daughter-matching-striped-babydoll-shirt-dress', '', '', '2026-04-28 18:58:51', '2026-04-28 18:58:51', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/mother-daughter-matching-striped-babydoll-shirt-dress/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(55, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Elevate your home aesthetic with the ultimate \"mini-me\" comfort. This matching family lounge set features a premium textured knit fabric designed for both style and relaxation. The set includes a long-sleeve oversized polo sweater with a deep V-neckline and a classic spread collar, paired with matching wide-leg lounge pants.\r\n\r\nThe timeless horizontal stripe pattern offers a sophisticated look for family lazy days, morning routines, or casual staycations. Available in two versatile colorways, these sets provide a coordinated, high-end feel while remaining incredibly soft against the skin. Whether you are cuddling up for a movie or snapping the perfect family photo, these matching knits are the perfect blend of cozy and cool.', 'Mom And Daughter Matching Striped Polo Knit Lounge Set', 'A cozy and chic matching two-piece knit set for moms and kids, featuring classic horizontal stripes and a relaxed polo collar.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'mom-and-daughter-matching-striped-polo-knit-lounge-set', '', '', '2026-04-28 20:49:01', '2026-04-28 20:49:01', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/mom-and-daughter-matching-striped-polo-knit-lounge-set/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(56, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Create unforgettable memories with this adorable matching mother and daughter dress collection. These sleeveless dresses are designed with a timeless pinstripe pattern and a relaxed A-line silhouette that offers both comfort and style.\r\n\r\nThe little girl\'s version features a full-length wood-style button back for easy dressing, while the women\'s version offers a flattering round neckline and a high-low ruffled hemline. Crafted from a lightweight, breathable linen-look fabric, these matching outfits are perfect for summer picnics, family vacations, or casual garden parties. The coordinated look allows you and your mini-me to twin effortlessly in three beautiful soft pastel shades.', 'Mother & Daughter Matching Striped Sleeveless Ruffle Dress', 'A charming and breezy matching sleeveless dress set for moms and littles, featuring classic vertical pinstripes, wood-style buttons, and a playful ruffled hem.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'mother-daughter-matching-striped-sleeveless-ruffle-dress', '', '', '2026-04-28 20:36:14', '2026-04-28 20:36:14', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/mother-daughter-matching-striped-sleeveless-ruffle-dress/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(57, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:14', '2026-04-27 21:49:14', 'Elevate your next family outing or photo session with these timeless matching outfits. Crafted from breathable, lightweight fabric, this set is designed for comfort during warm-weather celebrations.\r\n\r\nThe Boy\'s Outfit: Features a long-sleeved button-down shirt with a crisp collar and matching shorts for a polished yet playful look.\r\n\r\nThe Girl\'s Outfit: A sleeveless A-line dress featuring delicate ruffle detailing along the neckline and a breezy silhouette.\r\nThe matching vertical stripe pattern creates a cohesive, high-end aesthetic that is perfect for siblings, cousins, or friends.', 'Little Siblings Matching Red Stripe Summer Set', 'A charming coordinated collection featuring a button-down collared shirt for boys and a ruffled sleeveless dress for girls, both in a classic red and white vertical stripe.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'little-siblings-matching-red-stripe-summer-set', '', '', '2026-04-28 19:50:43', '2026-04-28 19:50:43', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/little-siblings-matching-red-stripe-summer-set/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(58, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:15', '2026-04-27 21:49:15', 'Embrace a timeless, maritime-inspired look with this elegant matching collection. Perfect for formal gatherings, school events, or family portraits, these outfits offer a polished aesthetic with a comfortable fit.\r\n\r\nThe Boy\'s Outfit: A classic navy short-sleeved polo shirt featuring a subtle embroidered crest, paired with crisp white tailored shorts for a clean, academic look.\r\n\r\nThe Girl\'s Outfit: A graceful navy sleeveless dress with a flared skirt and a contrasting white bow collar that perfectly mirrors the boy\'s ensemble.\r\nThe shared navy and white color palette ensures a seamless matching look that captures a refined, \"mini-me\" style for siblings.', 'Nautical Navy & White Sibling Matching Collection', 'A sophisticated and preppy matching set featuring a classic polo and shorts combo for boys and a coordinated sleeveless bow-accented dress for girls.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'nautical-navy-white-sibling-matching-collection', '', '', '2026-04-28 21:38:45', '2026-04-28 21:38:45', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/nautical-navy-white-sibling-matching-collection/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(59, 1, '2026-04-27 21:49:15', '2026-04-27 21:49:15', 'Hit the streets in style with this modern athletic matching set. Designed for active play and casual outings, these pieces combine a cool streetwear aesthetic with cozy, everyday comfort.\r\n\r\nThe Boy\'s Outfit: A sleek black V-neck pullover with contrasting white trim and \"23\" graphic, paired with matching black cargo-style joggers for a complete athletic ensemble.\r\n\r\nThe Girl\'s Outfit: A heather grey V-neck pullover that mirrors the varsity \"23\" design, perfectly complemented by a classic black pleated skirt for a sporty-chic finish.\r\nBoth outfits feature identical sleeve stripes and graphic prints, making them the ultimate matching choice for siblings who love a contemporary, urban vibe.', 'Varsity Sport Matching Sibling Pullover Set', 'A trendy and comfortable varsity-inspired collection featuring matching \"23\" graphic pullovers with side-stripe detailing for a sporty, coordinated look.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'varsity-sport-matching-sibling-pullover-set', '', '', '2026-04-28 21:30:17', '2026-04-28 21:30:17', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/produit/varsity-sport-matching-sibling-pullover-set/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
