(483, 1, '2026-04-28 09:51:03', '2026-04-28 09:51:03', 'Bring a playful energy to your relationship with our Hugging Hearts Matching Set. These sweatshirts feature a unique, two-tone pink and purple heart graphic on the chest, designed with cute interlocking characters that symbolize being better together.\n\nCrafted with a modern, oversized streetwear silhouette, these black pullovers are made from a high-quality cotton blend that offers ultimate comfort for date nights or casual hangouts. The drop-shoulder design and ribbed collar provide a relaxed look that fits both men and women perfectly. Whether you\'re celebrating an anniversary or just want to show off your dynamic, this set is a fun, stylish way to stay coordinated with your partner.', '\"Hugging Hearts\" Aesthetic Matching Couple Sweatshirts', 'Celebrate your connection with these \"Hugging Hearts\" matching sweatshirts. Featuring a whimsical, interlocking heart graphic that completes the picture when you\'re together, these oversized black pullovers are the perfect cozy statement for couples.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '48-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-04-28 09:51:03', '2026-04-28 09:51:03', '', 48, 'https://matchyx2.shop/?p=483', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
