(520, 1, '2026-04-28 13:24:43', '2026-04-28 13:24:43', 'Make your holiday memories unforgettable with this perfectly coordinated family pajama set. Designed for ultimate comfort during the winter season, these matching sets feature a soft heather grey long-sleeve top adorned with a modern \"Oh Deer\" reindeer silhouette and heart graphic.\n\nThe festive look is completed with vibrant red and black buffalo check plaid on the sleeves and matching full-length trousers. Available in sizes for adults, children, and infants (as a coordinated romper), this set is the ideal choice for Christmas morning photos, holiday movie marathons, or festive family gatherings.', '\"Oh Deer\" Matching Family Holiday Pajama Set', '<p>A festive and cozy matching pajama collection for the whole family, featuring a playful reindeer graphic and classic red-and-black buffalo plaid accents.</p>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '52-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-04-28 13:24:43', '2026-04-28 13:24:43', '', 52, 'https://matchyx2.shop/?p=520', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
