(574, 1, '2026-04-28 18:30:22', '2026-04-28 18:30:22', 'Capture the perfect \"mini-me\" moment with this elegant matching mother and daughter dress set. These light blue shirt dresses feature a timeless white vertical stripe pattern, blending a sophisticated collared look with a playful, relaxed fit.\n\nThe design includes a functional button-down front and a flattering high-waisted babydoll seam that creates a soft, flared skirt. Crafted from lightweight, breathable fabric, these dresses are ideal for sunny outings, weekend brunches, or family vacations. The short sleeves and classic collar ensure a look that is both polished and comfortable for all-day wear.', 'Mother & Daughter Matching Striped Babydoll Shirt Dress', '<p>A charming and breezy matching shirt dress set for moms and littles, featuring classic vertical stripes and a comfortable babydoll silhouette.</p>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '54-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-04-28 18:30:22', '2026-04-28 18:30:22', '', 54, 'https://matchyx2.shop/?p=574', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
