(632, 1, '2026-04-28 22:43:32', '2026-04-28 22:43:32', '', 'Elegant Polka Dot Flutter-Sleeve Matching Mother & Daughter Dresses', 'Celebrate your special bond in style with these charming polka dot matching dresses. Featuring playful flutter sleeves, a flattering wrap-style bodice, and a ruffled hem, these dresses are perfect for garden parties, family photoshoots, or a sunny day out.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'elegant-polka-dot-flutter-sleeve-matching-mother-daughter-dresses', '', '', '2026-04-28 22:43:21', '2026-04-28 22:43:21', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/?post_type=product&#038;p=632', 0, 'product', '', 0),
