(634, 2, '2026-04-28 22:37:49', '2026-04-28 22:37:49', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we are</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our website address is: <a href=\"http://matchyx2.shop\">https://matchyx2.shop</a>.<br>This website is a demo e-commerce project created for educational purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Comments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, as well as the visitor’s IP address and browser user agent string to help detect spam.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Media</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you upload images to the website, avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS). Visitors can download and extract location data from images on the website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cookies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you leave a comment, you may opt-in to saving your name, email address, and website in cookies. These are for your convenience so you do not need to fill in your details again.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you select “Remember Me”, your login will persist for two weeks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Embedded content from other websites</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, etc.). Embedded content behaves in the same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, and track your interaction with the embedded content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we share your data with</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long we retain your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For registered users (if any), we store the personal information they provide in their profile. Users can see, edit, or delete their information at any time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What rights you have over your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have an account or have left comments, you can request an exported file of your data or ask us to delete it. This does not include data we must keep for legal or security purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where your data is sent</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Privacy Policy', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-04-28 22:37:49', '2026-04-28 22:37:49', '', 3, 'https://matchyx2.shop/?p=634', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
