(718, 2, '2026-04-29 08:47:41', '2026-04-29 08:47:41', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Processing Time</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All orders are processed within <strong>1–3 business days</strong> after payment confirmation. Orders are not shipped or delivered on weekends or holidays.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If we experience a high volume of orders, shipments may be delayed by a few days. We will notify you if there is a significant delay.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Shipping Rates &amp; Delivery Estimates</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Shipping charges for your order will be calculated and displayed at checkout.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Estimated delivery times:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Local shipping:</strong> 2–5 business days</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>International shipping (if applicable):</strong> 7–15 business days</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Delivery times are estimates and may vary depending on your location and courier delays.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Order Tracking</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once your order has been shipped, you will receive a confirmation email with a <strong>tracking number</strong> so you can follow your package in real time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Shipping Confirmation</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You will receive a shipping confirmation email once your order has been dispatched. If you do not receive it, please check your spam folder or contact us.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Incorrect Address</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please make sure your shipping address is correct before placing your order. We are not responsible for orders shipped to incorrect addresses provided by the customer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Delays</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Delivery delays may occasionally occur due to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>High order volume</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Customs processing (for international orders)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Courier delays</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Weather conditions or holidays</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Lost or Stolen Packages</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are not responsible for lost or stolen packages once they are marked as “delivered.” If you experience an issue, please contact the shipping carrier first.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /w