(722, 2, '2026-04-29 08:53:52', '2026-04-29 08:53:52', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we are</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are an online fashion store offering matching outfits, accessories, and curated looks. Our goal is to help you create stylish, coordinated outfits with ease, combining quality, trend, and simplicity in one place.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our website address is: <a href=\"http://matchyx2.shop\">https://matchyx2.shop</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Comments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, as well as the visitor’s IP address and browser user agent string to help detect spam.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Media</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you upload images to the website, avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS). Visitors can download and extract location data from images on the website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cookies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you leave a comment, you may opt-in to saving your name, email address, and website in cookies. These are for your convenience so you do not need to fill in your details again.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you select “Remember Me”, your login will persist for two weeks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Embedded content from other websites</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, etc.). Embedded content behaves in the same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, and track your interaction with the embedded content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we share your data with</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long we retain your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For registered users (if any), we store the personal information they provide in their profile. Users can see, edit, or delete their information at any time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What rights you have over your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have an account or have left comments, you can request an exported file of your data or ask us to delete it. This does not include data we must keep for legal or security purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where your data is sent</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Privacy Policy', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-04-29 08:53:52', '2026-04-29 08:53:52', '', 3, 'https://matchyx2.shop/?p=722', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(723, 1, '2026-04-29 09:22:30', '2026-04-29 09:22:30', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to Matchyx2, your online fashion store dedicated to matching outfits for couples, families, and best friends. We believe that style becomes even more special when it is shared.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>⸻</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|color-0\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"color-0\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-color-0-color has-text-color has-link-color\"> <strong>Our Story</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Matchyx2 was created with a simple idea: clothing is more meaningful when it connects people. Whether it’s a couple sharing a special moment, a family creating memories, or best friends showing their bond, matching outfits help express that connection in a stylish and unique way.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>⸻</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|color-0\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"color-0\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-color-0-color has-text-color has-link-color\"> <strong>What We Do</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We design and select matching outfits and coordinated looks for:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Couples </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Families </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Best friends </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From casual wear to special occasions, our collections are made to help you match effortlessly while staying stylish and comfortable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>⸻</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|color-0\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"color-0\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-color-0-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Our Vision</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our vision is to turn fashion into a shared experience. We aim to make it easy for people to express their bond through coordinated styles that are modern, fun, and meaningful.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|color-0\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"color-0\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-color-0-color has-text-color has-link-color\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Us', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'about-us', '', '', '2026-04-29 09:23:37', '2026-04-29 09:23:37', '', 0, 'https://matchyx2.shop/?page_id=723', 0, 'page', '', 0),
